  ],
  "finalCues": [
    {
      "verse": 1,
      "text": "You have searched me, LORD, and you know me.",
      "start": 6.211,
      "end": 9.26
    },
    {
      "verse": 2,
      "text": "You know when I sit and when I rise; you perceive my thoughts from afar.",
      "start": 10.12,
      "end": 15.699
    },
    {
      "verse": 3,
      "text": "You discern my going out and my lying down; you are familiar with all my ways.",
      "start": 16.36,
      "end": 22.91
    },
    {
      "verse": 4,
      "text": "Before a word is on my tongue you, LORD, know it completely.",
      "start": 23.44,
      "end": 28.34
    },
    {
      "verse": 5,
      "text": "You hem me in behind and before, and you lay your hand upon me.",
      "start": 29.483,
      "end": 34.16
    },
    {
      "verse": 6,
      "text": "Such knowledge is too wonderful for me, too lofty for me to attain.",
      "start": 34.92,
      "end": 39.479
    },
    {
      "verse": 7,
      "text": "Where can I go from your Spirit? Where can I flee from your presence?",
      "start": 40.2,
      "end": 44.499
    },
    {
      "verse": 8,
      "text": "If I go up to the heavens, you are there; if I make my bed in the depths, you are there.",
      "start": 45.26,
      "end": 51.389
    },
    {
      "verse": 9,
      "text": "If I rise on the wings of the dawn, if I settle on the far side of the sea,",
      "start": 51.96,
      "end": 57.3
    },
    {
      "verse": 10,
      "text": "even there your hand will guide me, your right hand will hold me fast.",
      "start": 57.3,
      "end": 63.6
    },
    {
      "verse": 11,
      "text": "If I say, “Surely the darkness will hide me and the light become night around me,”",
      "start": 64.04,
      "end": 69.019
    },
    {
      "verse": 12,
      "text": "even the darkness will not be dark to you; the night will shine like the day, for darkness is as light to you.",
      "start": 69.22,
      "end": 77.74
    },
    {
      "verse": 13,
      "text": "For you created my inmost being; you knit me together in my mother’s womb.",
      "start": 78.08,
      "end": 84.04
    },
    {
      "verse": 14,
      "text": "I praise you because I am fearfully and wonderfully made; your works are wonderful, I know that full well.",
      "start": 84.62,
      "end": 93.159
    },
    {
      "verse": 15,
      "text": "My frame was not hidden from you when I was made in the secret place, when I was woven together in the depths of the earth.",
      "start": 93.78,
      "end": 102.479
    },
    {
      "verse": 16,
      "text": "Your eyes saw my unformed body; all the days ordained for me were written in your book before one of them came to be.",
      "start": 103.06,
      "end": 111.64
    },
    {
      "verse": 17,
      "text": "How precious to me are your thoughts, God! How vast is the sum of them!",
      "start": 112.3,
      "end": 117.3
    },
    {
      "verse": 18,
      "text": "Were I to count them, they would outnumber the grains of sand— when I awake, I am still with you.",
      "start": 117.34,
      "end": 123.939
    },
    {
      "verse": 19,
      "text": "If only you, God, would slay the wicked! Away from me, you who are bloodthirsty!",
      "start": 124.9,
      "end": 130.8
    },
    {
      "verse": 20,
      "text": "They speak of you with evil intent; your adversaries misuse your name.",
      "start": 130.92,
      "end": 136.019
    },
    {
      "verse": 21,
      "text": "Do I not hate those who hate you, LORD, and abhor those who are in rebellion against you?",
      "start": 136.6,
      "end": 142.959
    },
    {
      "verse": 22,
      "text": "I have nothing but hatred for them; I count them my enemies.",
      "start": 143.72,
      "end": 147.679
    },
    {
      "verse": 23,
      "text": "Search me, God, and know my heart; test me and know my anxious thoughts.",
      "start": 148.24,
      "end": 153.55
    },
    {
      "verse": 24,
      "text": "See if there is any offensive way in me, and lead me in the way everlasting.",
      "start": 153.68,
      "end": 160.76
    }
  ],
